 "library": {
  "title": "Tall bookcase 800x300x2000 with books",
  "description": "Wooden tall bookcase, 800 wide x 300 deep x 2000 high. It has a 20 mm carcass and four inner shelves, giving five levels 392 apart, each filled with rows of coloured books. The BookRow module (w, h, seed) makes 30 mm-wide books in 300 mm blocks. Its origin is the back-left-bottom corner.",
